      "institution": "Tencent Hunyuan, Tsinghua University, Nanjing University, HKUST, UIUC, Peking University",
      "summary": {
        "zh": "SceneActBench 填补了评估VLM智能体在完整多对象3D场景中执行视觉条件动作的空白。通过引入基于几何精度的统一评估框架，揭示了当前主流VLM在3D理解和行动能力上的不足与不一致性，为未来提升智能体的3D交互能力提供了重要的评估标准和方向。",
        "en": "- **Background**: Vision-language model (VLM) agents are increasingly using tools to act on 3D scenes rather than just describing them. Acting on a scene is a stronger test of an agent's 3D understanding."
      },
